    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classQfMapToScreen" kindref="compound">QfMapToScreen</ref> class transform a map point to screen coordinates. The map point CRS is the one from the map settings. Screen point will be automatically updated on map extent changes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
